ll},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-03-25T09:11:17Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T13:48:47Z","closed_at":"2025-03-25T16:15:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104592","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104592.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104592.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-25T16:15:06Z"},"body":"We got this from RenderDoc which had an issue with it 5 years ago, but it's not a given that Godot is also affected.\r\n\r\nThis layer is actually quite convenient to be able to change what default Vulkan capable GPU should be used for applications via environment variables: https://docs.mesa3d.org/envvars.html#vulkan-mesa-device-select-layer-environment-variables\r\n\r\nIn my case:\r\n```\r\n$ MESA_VK_DEVICE_SELECT=list vulkaninfo \r\nselectable devices:\r\n  GPU 0: 1002:7480 \"AMD Radeon RX 7600M XT (RADV NAVI33)\" discrete GPU 0000:03:00.0\r\n  GPU 1: 1002:1900 \"AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV PHOENIX)\" integrated GPU 0000:69:00.0\r\n  GPU 2: 10005:0 \"llvmpipe (LLVM 19.1.7, 256 bits)\" CPU 0000:00:00.0\r\n```\r\n\r\nI want to default to the integrated GPU to reduce power consumption/fan usage when I don't need full high performance (I mostly have Godot running in the background when I tried to reproduce a bug and then forgot to close the instance).\r\n\r\nSo I can set\r\n```\r\nexport MESA_VK_DEVICE_SELECT=\"1002:1900!\"\r\n```\r\nin my `~/.bashrc`, and have Godot and other Vulkan applications automatically use the iGPU, unless requested explicitly with another override. I defined those aliases for that:\r\n```\r\nalias vkdgpu=\"MESA_VK_DEVICE_SELECT='1002:7480!' $@\"\r\nalias vkigpu=\"MESA_VK_DEVICE_SELECT='1002:1900!' $@\"\r\nalias vklvp=\"MESA_VK_DEVICE_SELECT='10005:0!' $@\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe RenderDoc disable was due to this bug: https://github.com/baldurk/renderdoc/issues/2093\r\n\r\nI'm not aware of such issues affecting us up until now, and we included this from RenderDoc in #104154 pretty recently (4.5-dev1 and 4.4.1). So it seems safe to revert this part, and just keep an eye on potential Linux + Mesa crash reports which we could trace back to such an issue (we can ask users to test with `NODEVICE_SELECT=1 godot --rendering-driver vulkan`).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104592/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}